","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibility(removeTraits:)":{"deprecated":true,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibility","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"removeTraits","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AccessibilityTraits","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI19AccessibilityTraitsV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModifiedContent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(removetraits:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibility(removeTraits:)","title":"accessibility(re